From 69d88dd3ad2b27bbf672cac5cd3c2b51246efd79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:17:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Publish the canonical combined configuration schema

Base: openai/codex rust-v0.163.0
(83086188ae0614bd882818ff1aa23f3194962012). Prerequisite: the complete
preceding runtime and build patch queue, including issue70.
scripts/apply-patches.sh applies this shared generated fixture after the
runtime feature patches.

Include unleashed_readable_commands in both feature-property locations.
The previous combined fixture omits the newly registered boolean; the real
schema CLI emits it. Preserve byte and semantic fixture comparisons, Cargo
and Bazel resource resolution, and Windows CRLF normalization.

The schema CLI regression resolves binaries and resources through the
maintained cargo-bin helpers so manifest-only Windows runfiles are usable.
Its dev-dependency belongs to this schema patch.
